{"parse": {"title": "AR-8", "pageid": 89278, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AR-7\" title=\"AR-7\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AR-8</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AR</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">8</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.BE.BD.E9.98.94.E5.9C.B0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"辽阔地\">辽阔地</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 辽阔地</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Endless Shoreline</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我曾以为旁人的看法对37来说不值一提。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>即使在更激烈的争执中，她也不曾对此多加关注。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>以寻常的眼睛，无法观测到广阔之物的变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但我现在已经明白怎样察觉它们——手指抚过几何体时细微的剐蹭，弯腰时捧起的各不相同的沙粒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>那样的转变太缓慢，但依然存在。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿波罗之星已升到了头顶，赫尔墨斯之星的游戏也宣告结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>该回到那间散落着纸张的研究室了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……？37，你在想什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37的步伐反常地缓慢，兴许是那场宣判给了她太大打击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>历来恪尽职守的除错师在此刻有些后悔——也许维持平衡这件事，还是由6来最合适。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……苏菲亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37沉闷地开头，尾音相较往常更加平板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我并没有浪费你的时间，是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你也认为我做的这些有意义，不只是玩耍而已？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将这些疑惑一股脑儿倒了出来，迫切地等待着回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>当然！对我来说，这首歌是十分珍贵的回忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你不开心吗，37？刚刚共同听歌时，你并没有那么沮丧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>嗯，因为它的韵律很美，你唱得也很好听！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赞美来得真诚且迅速，不容置疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>不过让我意外的是，你提起的那个关于无限个质数的证明……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我还记得它，但我完全不记得什么时候告诉过你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我当然记得，37。那是个很美的证明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我会一直记住它的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这话没有起到多少安慰的作用，37心烦意乱地抓着自己的头发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……所以，我并没有搅乱你和休的回忆，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>没有自顾自地跑来，把你的圆打乱，然后留下一地碎屑……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏菲亚微微瞪大了眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>37，你难道还在介意210说的话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的目光移开了——这真是少有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……哈哈哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>？！苏菲亚，你在笑什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>抱歉……只是没想到你竟然会在意他说的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你说得对，和过去比起来，你确实有许多变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>当然了！我不是说过吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>除了身高，其实我在餐桌上选择的座位也变了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>因为我与桌面的距离在变化，最好的晒太阳角度就会跟着改变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>不仅仅是身高或座位……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏菲亚带着笑意，轻轻摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>童年结束后，她很少如此柔软。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>37，你知道我为何会一直记得那个无限质数的证明吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>因为它让我第一次去思考那样遥远的事物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>过去我不会关心何谓永恒，因为这更像不可捉摸的传言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>现在我站在这儿，非常清楚脚下的岛屿终有一天会消失，像细沙被海潮冲走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>——但我也相信一些东西会长久地留存，如同埋藏于泥沙中的金粒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>岛屿足够宽广，能容下整个学派的人在此定居。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同样，岛屿也如此微末，只是处在波浪之中的一个小点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>置身其中的生命所能记住的，也不过是一些短暂的瞬间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>嗯，因为现象世界都是易朽的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37煞有介事地点了点头，对她来说这样的话题比吃饭更加寻常。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你把它分享给了我，因为里面蕴含的永恒和无限之美，它普遍的正确性。从此，我看见了砂砾中的黄金。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>而我把休留下的歌儿分享给了你。它令你快乐，因此它对你也有了意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>这或许不是你所寻求的超验的智慧。但听过这首歌的人会感受它，记住它——或许有一天随口哼起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>这也是普遍的美丽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……！原来是这样——我完全明白了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37脸上的困惑迅速褪去，她又恢复了往常快活的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这支歌儿不再只属于休和苏菲亚了，因为你把它分享给了我们……对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>它因此拥有了普遍性，属于听过它的每一个人！就像我分享给你的证明！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……为什么你又笑了，苏菲亚？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……不，没什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>只是在想，你好像非要把所有事都转化为证明才能理解似的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>明明只是和朋友一起听歌这样简单的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……唔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>看来我对简单的体会还不够深……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37苦苦思索起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好在，她马上又想到了新点子。总是如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>“分享”真的是一个非常好的论点——我笃定210很难提出反对！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我的观点是正确的！我现在就把这个告诉他！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37跑向前方，追上了正在翻看杂志的210。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>噢，那又如何？苏菲亚宣告我取得胜利的事实并不会随之改变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你只是在看热闹，做些随意的猜测，而我找到了那支重要的歌！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>随你怎么想——我今天已经说了够多的话，决定独自待一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他刻意放缓了脚步，落在苏菲亚与37身后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37将此当作210妥协的宣告，步伐也跟着变得轻快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>嗯，除了不重要的细节，今天的一切都很顺利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>是数字“9”，三倍的和平、友谊与和谐。非常完美。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>对了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像是突然想起了什么，37转向苏菲亚，愉快地笑起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>来，苏菲亚，伸手——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这个给你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>羽毛，贝壳与小石头串成的漂亮装饰物落入手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>旁边还有一块孤零零的卵石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508313.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508313.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……这是给我的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>当然！还有这个，我刚刚在海滩上发现了这枚石头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>它的纹路拼成的数字很棒！你可以让它加入这串项链——或者，拿去打水漂！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>谢谢你，37。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我早上到沙滩这儿来的时候，就想把它拿给你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>那时候我忙着思考别的，这件事被忘了个干净……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>最后我还是收到了礼物，所以没关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>那就好！明天我们还会一起玩儿吗，苏菲亚？我很快就能赶上研究进度的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>哦，大后天也行，我们可以让它变成岛上的固定项目——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼下是一个很好的机会，轻松，愉快，足以让她把未讲的话问出口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>37，对你来说，所有的数都一样吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>当然了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有丝毫犹豫，37立刻回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你也认为37只是一个数字吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>如果不是数，它又是什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>210，37，6……即使我们不在这儿了，这些数也不会随之消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>同样，也不需要3只海鸥，3块石头，3个人来证明3的存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>数字只是一直在那里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>谢谢你，37。这是很好的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我想我得先处理剩下的事务。如果还有时间，我们总能一起玩的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>那就说好了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>噢，等等，我看见6散步回来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37望向远处逐渐步近的小点，一只海鸥正在上方盘旋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她蹦起来，很高兴地朝领袖打招呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>上午好，6！我和210对一件事有不同想法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>简单来说，这个数列与一首歌有关……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>我并不具备你所认为的鉴赏能力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>但你很讲道理，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>有哪条教义适用于这种情况吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>沉思能够带来智识的净化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>也许保持一段时间的静默能帮助你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这不适合我。好吧，我会自己想出更有说服力的新论点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看得出来，37对6给出的方案不够满意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在接下来的日子里，讨论还将持续下去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_at_haitanshang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_at_haitanshang1\"><img alt=\"1_4_at_haitanshang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-1_4_at_haitanshang1.png/600px-Cg-1_4_at_haitanshang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-1_4_at_haitanshang1.png/900px-Cg-1_4_at_haitanshang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-1_4_at_haitanshang1.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_at_haitanshang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508313.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508313.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>走路的时候得注意前方，否则很容易摔伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>没关系，只要按照固定的顺序迈出脚步，就不会有问题！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>容我提醒，得再快点儿才不会错过用餐时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>这只海鸥看起来也饿得够呛。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_at_haitanshang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_at_haitanshang2\"><img alt=\"1_4_at_haitanshang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-1_4_at_haitanshang2.png/600px-Cg-1_4_at_haitanshang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-1_4_at_haitanshang2.png/900px-Cg-1_4_at_haitanshang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-1_4_at_haitanshang2.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_at_haitanshang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我们数出走了多少步，就可以借此计算海鸥飞行的速度……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>刚才数到哪里了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>你大可以明天待在沙滩上数一整天海鸥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>噢，我的下篇投稿以此为题也不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你又要用一堆形容词掩饰论证的缺乏吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>好了，快走吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>还有其他方法可以算出它的速度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-307910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-307910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-307910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>284步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>谢谢你，6！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>走到这儿花费的时间是……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AR-8"}}